  "summary_en": "Full text of China's comprehensively revised Civil Aviation Law, adopted 27 December 2025 and effective 1 July 2026. It covers aircraft registration, airworthiness, airports, air navigation, carrier liability, third-party damage and safety. It includes brief provisions on civil unmanned aircraft airworthiness and low-altitude economy.",
