   "Art. 225: promotes low-altitude economy, regulatory platforms, and airworthiness and flight management standards.",
   "Chapter 10: operator liability for third-party damage, mandatory third-party liability insurance.",
   "Art. 221: risk-based tiered airworthiness management."
